---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About Inscio | NetSuite Consulting Firm"
  description="NetSuite Expertise, Without the Noise. Inscio was founded because we saw the same patterns over and over — honest about scope, disciplined about execution."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-28 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-blue-400 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">COMPANY</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight mb-8 max-w-3xl">NetSuite Expertise, Without the Noise.</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Our only agenda is yours: simplify, scale, and grow.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block mt-10 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
        Schedule a Strategy Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">We are on a mission to empower companies</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
        We believe NetSuite should work for your business — not the other way around. Our mission is to make ERP implementations less painful, faster to value, and easier to live with. From day-one rollouts to decade-long partnerships, we help companies run smarter on the platform they've already chosen.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">The story behind how our company was founded</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Inscio was founded because we saw the same patterns over and over — overscoped implementations, stalled rollouts, customers left holding a configuration they couldn't actually run. We built Inscio to be the partner we wished we'd had: honest about scope, disciplined about execution, and in it for the long haul after go-live.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-8 py-2">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-700 italic leading-relaxed">
          "Our job is to make NetSuite feel like it was built for your business — and then get out of the way so your team can run on it."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-14">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our values</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg">The principles we bring to every engagement and every relationship.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {[
          {
            title: 'Hard Work',
            desc: 'We do the unglamorous parts of NetSuite work — the data migrations, edge-case testing, and boring configuration — because that\'s what separates a rollout that actually works from one that just launches.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Transparency',
            desc: 'We tell you what\'s hard before it becomes a surprise. Scope risks, timeline slippage, licensing tradeoffs — you hear about them early, not at go-live.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Innovation',
            desc: 'We build reusable accelerators — like DealerCloud for equipment dealers — so you don\'t pay to solve the same problem from scratch. Proven patterns, faster time-to-value.'
          },
          {
            title: 'Teamwork',
            desc: "The best implementations happen when it feels like one team, not two. We bring the NetSuite expertise, you bring the business knowledge, and together we build something that works for the people using it every day."
          },
          {
            title: 'Growth',
            desc: 'Good NetSuite work compounds. We scope each phase so your next acquisition, new subsidiary, or product line lands on a foundation that\'s already built to grow.'
          },
        ].map(value => (
          <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">{value.title}</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">{value.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Life at Inscio -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-blue-600 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Our culture</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Life at Inscio</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">Twenty years in, we still show up like it's the best job we've ever had. Here's proof.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab buttons -->
      <div class="flex gap-3 mb-8" id="culture-tabs">
        <button
          class="culture-tab active-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all"
          data-panel="celebrate"
        >🏆 Celebrate</button>
        <button
          class="culture-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all"
          data-panel="fun"
        >🎉 Have fun</button>
        <button
          class="culture-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium border transition-all"
          data-panel="giveback"
        >❤️ Give back</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Celebrate panel -->
      <div id="panel-celebrate" class="culture-panel">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 280px 220px;">
          <!-- Big feature photo -->
          <div class="col-span-2 row-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/anniversary-celebration.jpg" alt="Inscio 20th anniversary celebration" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>20th anniversary party</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 to-transparent p-5">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Inscio | 20 years</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Smaller photos right column -->
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/inc500-winner.jpg" alt="Inc 500 Top 100 winner" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Inc 500 — Top 100</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-xs font-medium">Inc 500 — Winner Top 100</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#152060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/anniversary-team.jpg" alt="Inscio team at 20th anniversary" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>The whole crew</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-xs font-medium">The whole crew</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Have fun panel -->
      <div id="panel-fun" class="culture-panel hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 280px 220px;">
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#2d1060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/team-laughing.jpg" alt="Team laughing at dinner" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Team dinner — laughing</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Never a dull lunch</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a0a40] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/live-music-night.jpg" alt="Team at live music night" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Live music — Tolbert's</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Team night out</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0D1235] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/holiday-party.jpg" alt="Holiday party at Bad Santa's Boathouse" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Holiday party</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Annual holiday party</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a2060] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/dance-moves.jpg" alt="Team member celebrating" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Good vibes</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Someone had a good time</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Give back panel -->
      <div id="panel-giveback" class="culture-panel hidden">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" style="grid-template-rows: 280px 220px;">
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a3020] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-sports.jpg" alt="Volunteering at youth sports facility" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Youth sports day</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Youth sports day</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#1a3010] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-lawn-games.jpg" alt="Team at community outdoor event" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Community event</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Community event</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#0a2810] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-kids.jpg" alt="Team with kids at facility" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>Playing hard, giving back</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">Giving back, playing hard</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative bg-[#102810] group">
            <img src="/images/culture/volunteer-group.jpg" alt="Whole team at community event" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex'" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 hidden flex-col items-center justify-center text-white/30 text-sm gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"/><path d="m21 15-5-5L5 21"/></svg>
              <span>The whole team pitches in</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-transparent p-4">
              <span class="text-white text-sm font-medium">The whole team pitches in</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stat strip -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">20 Years</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">together as a team</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Inc 500</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">recognized growth company</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">People First</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">always, in everything we do</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="bg-[#0D1235] text-white py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Ready to work with us?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-10">Book a free strategy call and tell us where you are with NetSuite. No pressure, no sales pitch — just honest conversation.</p>
      <a href="https://calendly.com/brian-gallagher-inscio/netsuite-strategy-session" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded transition-colors">
        Schedule a Strategy Call
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<script>
  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.culture-tab');
  const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.culture-panel');

  tabs.forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const target = tab.dataset.panel;

      tabs.forEach(t => {
        t.classList.remove('active-tab', 'bg-white', 'text-gray-900', 'border-gray-300', 'shadow-sm');
        t.classList.add('text-gray-500', 'border-gray-200', 'hover:border-gray-300', 'hover:text-gray-700');
      });
      tab.classList.add('active-tab', 'bg-white', 'text-gray-900', 'border-gray-300', 'shadow-sm');
      tab.classList.remove('text-gray-500', 'border-gray-200');

      panels.forEach(p => p.classList.add('hidden'));
      document.getElementById('panel-' + target)?.classList.remove('hidden');
    });
  });

  // Set initial tab styles
  tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
    if (i === 0) {
      tab.classList.add('bg-white', 'text-gray-900', 'border-gray-300', 'shadow-sm');
    } else {
      tab.classList.add('text-gray-500', 'border-gray-200', 'hover:border-gray-300', 'hover:text-gray-700');
    }
  });
</script>
